  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Montserrat Marine Unit Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A project in support of the Royal Montserrat Police Service (RMPS) with a phased capability programme, in particular to help enhance the Marine Unit in getting the best out of their marine vessels.  The project includes assessments, evaluations, training and mentoring.</narrative>
  </description>
